Description: Fix CVE-2025-27152 - SSRF / credential leak via absolute request URL
 overriding a preconfigured baseURL. buildFullPath now accepts an
 allowAbsoluteUrls flag; when false the request URL is combined with the
 baseURL instead of replacing it. The flag is resolved in Axios#request
 (default true for backward compatibility) and propagated to every
 buildFullPath call site (http adapter, xhr/fetch resolveConfig, getUri).
 Includes the follow-up operator-precedence fix so allowAbsoluteUrls:false
 without a baseURL no longer combines/throws.
